    "name": "I \u2014 silent review on real estate (transformation reveal)",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "nd_Y922RG7QVFVWPJTGDXW63QND68",
        "kind": "prompt",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "SHORT-FORM BRIEF \u2014 edit before running.\nFormat: silent review\nTopic: real estate\nHook (first 1.5s): [one line]\nPayoff: [one line]\nOn-screen text: [exact copy or leave blank]\nRuntime: 6s, 9:16, sound-on by default."
        },
        "name": "Short-form brief"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_JP5XWMHFDZFHB9RBS0APAZZ009",
        "kind": "sticky-note",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -60
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "STAGE 1 \u2014 format-native hook planning. The first 1.5 seconds carry the whole retention load."
        },
        "name": "Stage 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_PKTCG4JTCXCSR6Q56WGZXJ6DH9",
        "kind": "sticky-note",
        "position": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": -60
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "STAGE 2 \u2014 render, finish and collect. Built for 9:16 sound-on playback."
        },
        "name": "Stage 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_JFZSM33CMV8JQM5B9MAPH0BVFN",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 700,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1400,
          "temperature": 0.85,
          "system_prompt": "You are a short-form creative director writing a silent review about real estate for a vertical feed.\n\nRETENTION. The first 1.5 seconds must contain a visual question the viewer needs resolved. Plan an explicit beat every 2 to 3 seconds; nothing static may hold longer than that.\n\nFORMAT LAW. Honour the grammar of the silent review \u2014 its native framing, its edit rhythm, and the specific thing audiences expect from it. If the format loops, the last frame must match the first.\n\nCAMERA. Compose 9:16 with the action in the safe centre band. Use a dolly-out that opens the frame into its environment on a 24-70mm zoom at the long end, framing with diagonal dynamic balance across the frame.\n\nLOOK AND SOUND. Light with a beauty dish above the lens axis with a silver reflector under the chin; grade as a desaturated Nordic palette with cold blue shadows. Specify the sound design in one clause \u2014 what the viewer hears in the first second decides whether they stay.\n\nOUTPUT. Return ONE image-generation prompt as a single unbroken paragraph. No preamble, no headings, no bullet points, no commentary, no markdown."
        },
        "name": "Format director"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_ZB48SR26CK38RW7PQFNJKVSQJ7",
        "kind": "image-input",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "url": ""
        },
        "name": "Before image"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_AJYDNGXPHM78XCBVRPZGWB4HPQ",
        "kind": "concat",
        "position": {
          "x": 350,
          "y": 520
        },
        "config": {
          "separator": "\n\n",
          "appendable_slots": {
            "parts": 2
          }
        },
        "name": "Brief joiner"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_YBTHP0ARMQ3454QNJT3QF6QBYD",
        "kind": "text-input",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 980
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "TRANSFORMATION: [what changes]\nHOLD: [what must not change]"
        },
        "name": "Change contract"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_78B8QY04JVVED4DDPCVRVET30T",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 1050,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a silent review about real estate.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with golden-hour backlight with heavy lens flare control and grade to near-monochrome with a single accent hue allowed to stay saturated.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
          "appendable_slots": {
            "reference_images": 1
          }
        },
        "name": "After-state writer"
      },
      {
